{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 2, "text": "纳人一个严密的神灵体系中。", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 278, "w": 515, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "纳人一个严密的神灵体系中。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 278, "w": 515, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 3, "text": "尽管如此，摩教已基本上成为一种宗教，它以鬼魂观念作为信仰的思想基础，以祖先", "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 342, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "尽管如此，摩教已基本上成为一种宗教，它以鬼魂观念作为信仰的思想基础，以祖先", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 145, "y": 342, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 4, "text": "崇拜信仰的核心，以解脱疾病和导引亡灵进入极乐世界为信仰宗旨。摩教是在原始宗", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 402, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "崇拜信仰的核心，以解脱疾病和导引亡灵进入极乐世界为信仰宗旨。摩教是在原始宗", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 402, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 5, "text": "教基础上产生的，它包含了很多原始宗教的内容。例如，自然崇拜、动植物崇拜、图腾崇", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 471, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "教基础上产生的，它包含了很多原始宗教的内容。例如，自然崇拜、动植物崇拜、图腾崇", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 471, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 6, "text": "拜、鬼魂和祖先崇拜、灵物崇拜和偶像崇拜等都构成了摩教的基本内容。", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 531, "w": 1254, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "拜、鬼魂和祖先崇拜、灵物崇拜和偶像崇拜等都构成了摩教的基本内容。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 531, "w": 1254, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 7, "text": "摩教的仪式主要有超度亡灵的“殡亡”、“开路”等；超度凶死者的“招魂”；祈求五谷", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 595, "w": 1459, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "摩教的仪式主要有超度亡灵的“殡亡”、“开路”等；超度凶死者的“招魂”；祈求五谷", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 595, "w": 1459, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 8, "text": "丰登的“赎钱魂粮魂”；祈求全寨安康兴旺的“访几”；祈求富贵双全的“请龙”；驱逐邪鬼", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 660, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "丰登的“赎钱魂粮魂”；祈求全寨安康兴旺的“访几”；祈求富贵双全的“请龙”；驱逐邪鬼", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 660, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 9, "text": "的“退仙”、“扫火星神”、“移克魂”、“扫家”，等等；祈求生子的“架桥”；为小儿消灾除病", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 724, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "的“退仙”、“扫火星神”、“移克魂”、“扫家”，等等；祈求生子的“架桥”；为小儿消灾除病", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 724, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 10, "text": "“搭花桥”、“拜保爷”，等等；还有祭祀自然神的“祭虫神”、“祭河神”", "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 789, "w": 1186, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“搭花桥”、“拜保爷”，等等；还有祭祀自然神的“祭虫神”、“祭河神”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 60, "y": 789, "w": 1186, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 11, "text": "、“祭水神”等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 1234, "y": 789, "w": 261, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "、“祭水神”等。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 1234, "y": 789, "w": 261, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 12, "text": "佛、道二教对布依族古代宗教产生了一些影响，但远未达到全盘接受的程度。佛教", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 861, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "佛、道二教对布依族古代宗教产生了一些影响，但远未达到全盘接受的程度。佛教", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 861, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 13, "text": "开始传入贵州是在唐代，主要传入黔北、黔东一带。宋、元两代，安顺、普定等布依族聚居", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 921, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "开始传入贵州是在唐代，主要传入黔北、黔东一带。宋、元两代，安顺、普定等布依族聚居", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 921, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 14, "text": "地区已经出现佛教寺庙，估计这时期佛教观念就已开始渗入布依族地区。道教中的天师", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 990, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "地区已经出现佛教寺庙，估计这时期佛教观念就已开始渗入布依族地区。道教中的天师", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 990, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 15, "text": "道汉代产生于距贵州较近的四川。《蜀记》中有“米民之山獠”的记载。“米民”指天师道", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1045, "w": 1544, "h": 65}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "道汉代产生于距贵州较近的四川。《蜀记》中有“米民之山獠”的记载。“米民”指天师道", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1045, "w": 1544, "h": 65}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 16, "text": "教民，“獠”是“僚”的辱写。而“僚”与布依族先民有关。这说明汉代时道教已开始传入", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1114, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "教民，“獠”是“僚”的辱写。而“僚”与布依族先民有关。这说明汉代时道教已开始传入", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1114, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 17, "text": "布依族地区。佛、道二教传入布依族地区后，被布摩吸收进了摩教中，成了摩教中的有机", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1183, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族地区。佛、道二教传入布依族地区后，被布摩吸收进了摩教中，成了摩教中的有机", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1183, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 18, "text": "组成部分。如一些地区的“殡亡经”中，亡灵进入仙界需经过“十殿”，这明显受到佛教", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1243, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "组成部分。如一些地区的“殡亡经”中，亡灵进入仙界需经过“十殿”，这明显受到佛教", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1243, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 19, "text": "“十殿阎王”观念的影响。经文中对极乐世界的描绘，也无疑受到了道教的启发。", "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 1308, "w": 1403, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“十殿阎王”观念的影响。经文中对极乐世界的描绘，也无疑受到了道教的启发。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 64, "y": 1308, "w": 1403, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 20, "text": "布依族古代巫术主要有“神判”、“驱鬼”", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1372, "w": 700, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族古代巫术主要有“神判”、“驱鬼”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1372, "w": 700, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 21, "text": "、“医疗”", "bbox_px": {"x": 828, "y": 1372, "w": 173, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "、“医疗”", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 828, "y": 1372, "w": 173, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 22, "text": "、“禳解”几类。神判巫术是用来判", "bbox_px": {"x": 993, "y": 1372, "w": 619, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "、“禳解”几类。神判巫术是用来判", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 993, "y": 1372, "w": 619, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 23, "text": "定疑案的，有“呼风唤雨”、“捞油锅”两种形式，都是企图利用超自然力量来裁决是非。驱", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1436, "w": 1544, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "定疑案的，有“呼风唤雨”、“捞油锅”两种形式，都是企图利用超自然力量来裁决是非。驱", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1436, "w": 1544, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 24, "text": "鬼与医疗巫术常同时使用。人们认为生病是因为有邪鬼附身，必须将其驱走，病人才会", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1505, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "鬼与医疗巫术常同时使用。人们认为生病是因为有邪鬼附身，必须将其驱走，病人才会", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1505, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 25, "text": "痊愈。情爱巫术是采用某种巫术手段，以获取自己心仪者的心。禳解巫术是企图通过仪", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1569, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "痊愈。情爱巫术是采用某种巫术手段，以获取自己心仪者的心。禳解巫术是企图通过仪", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1569, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 26, "text": "式解除人身上的某种厄运。", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1637, "w": 474, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "式解除人身上的某种厄运。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1637, "w": 474, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 27, "text": "布依族古代巫术的形式主要模拟巫术和接触巫术，而以前者为多。占卜也是古代", "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1698, "w": 1459, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族古代巫术的形式主要模拟巫术和接触巫术，而以前者为多。占卜也是古代", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 153, "y": 1698, "w": 1459, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 28, "text": "布依族巫术的一种形式，有“鸡骨卜”", "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1758, "w": 648, "h": 62}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族巫术的一种形式，有“鸡骨卜”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 72, "y": 1758, "w": 648, "h": 62}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 29, "text": "、“蛋卜”、“茅卜”、“铜钱卜”等数种。明代郭子章在", "bbox_px": {"x": 708, "y": 1758, "w": 905, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "、“蛋卜”、“茅卜”、“铜钱卜”等数种。明代郭子章在", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 708, "y": 1758, "w": 905, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 30, "text": "《黔记•仲家》中就说布依族占卜“用茅或铜钱、鸡骨”。行使巫者有布摩，也有“亚押”", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1819, "w": 1548, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "《黔记•仲家》中就说布依族占卜“用茅或铜钱、鸡骨”。行使巫者有布摩，也有“亚押”", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1819, "w": 1548, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 31, "text": "（女巫），而以后者为多。", "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1895, "w": 422, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "（女巫），而以后者为多。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 68, "y": 1895, "w": 422, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 32, "text": "4. 节日", "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1963, "w": 133, "h": 41}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "4. 节日", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 149, "y": 1963, "w": 133, "h": 41}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 62, "line_no": 33, "text": "由于稻作农业的发展，布依族古代在季节性的农业祭祀基础上，形成了固定的节日。", "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 2024, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "由于稻作农业的发展，布依族古代在季节性的农业祭祀基础上，形成了固定的节日。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 157, "y": 2024, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
